# Bicycles (live canvas)

The P5 bicycle sketch, translated. `wchntMaths` is injected through the
factory (a free name in each `@WCHNTMaths` slot collapses to one factory
argument); every Bicycle keeps the shared reference and pulls `randInt`s in
`step`. Target draws the scene with the portable `wchntGraphics` API.

Construction cannot call `maths.randInt` yet (construction lets only accept
literals/constructions), so the five bikes start from fixed, varied values;
all the ongoing randomness lives in `Bicycle::step`.

## Schema

```
Game = [Bicycle]/bikes Int/w Int/h
Bicycle = Int/x Int/y Int/size Int/dx Int/dy Int/dSize Int/colour @WCHNTMaths/maths
```

## Construction

```
b1 = [:Bicycle 100 320 40 2 0 0 5294335 maths].
b2 = [:Bicycle 300 280 60 1 0 0 16732415 maths].
b3 = [:Bicycle 520 350 30 3 0 0 16752895 maths].
b4 = [:Bicycle 700 300 50 2 0 0 3997695 maths].
b5 = [:Bicycle 160 430 45 1 0 0 13172735 maths].
[:Game [:Array/Bicycle b1 b2 b3 b4 b5] 800 600]
```

## Methods

```
Bicycle::step = { Int/w, Int/h |
  x1 = x + dx.
  wrappedX = (x1 > (w + size)).
  x2 = if (wrappedX) { (0 - (size * 4)) } else { x1 }.
  y2 = if (wrappedX) { ((h / 2) + maths.randInt((h / 2))) } else { y }.
  y3 = y2 + dy.
  fell = (y3 > (h + 100)).
  y4 = if (fell) { ((h / 2) + maths.randInt((h / 2))) } else { y3 }.
  dy2 = if (fell) { 0 } else { dy }.
  dx2 = if (fell) { 1 + maths.randInt(4) } else { dx }.
  x3 = if (fell) { -100 } else { x2 }.
  falling = (maths.randInt(800) == 0).
  dx3 = if (falling) { 0 } else { dx2 }.
  dy3 = if (falling) { 10 } else { dy2 }.
  size2 = size - dSize.
  tiny = (size2 < 1).
  x4 = if (tiny) { -100 } else { x3 }.
  size3 = if (tiny) { 50 + maths.randInt(50) } else { size2 }.
  dSize2 = if (tiny) { 0 } else { dSize }.
  shrinking = (maths.randInt(3000) == 0).
  dSize3 = if (shrinking) { 1 } else { dSize2 }.
  [:Bicycle x4 y4 size3 dx3 dy3 dSize3 colour maths]
}

Game::step = {
  moved = bikes.map({ Bicycle/b | b.step(w, h) }).
  [:Game moved w h]
}
```

## Target

```
%canvas

%requires
WCHNTMaths::randInt(Int) -> Int

%init
var assemblage;

function init() {
    assemblage = GameAssemblage.factory(wchntMaths);
}

%step
function step() {
    assemblage = assemblage.step();
    var w = assemblage.w;
    var h = assemblage.h;
    var horizon = h / 2;

    wchntGraphics.background(0x18EAFF, 0.196);
    wchntGraphics.clear();

    var r = 150, g = 255, b = 100;
    var dr = horizon / 100, dg = horizon / 200, db = horizon / 50;
    for (var i = 0; i < horizon; i++) {
        r -= dr; g -= dg; b -= db;
        var rr = Math.max(0, r) | 0;
        var gg = Math.max(0, g) | 0;
        var bb = Math.max(0, b) | 0;
        wchntGraphics.beginFill(rr * 65536 + gg * 256 + bb);
        wchntGraphics.drawRect(0, horizon + i, w, 2);
        wchntGraphics.endFill();
    }

    for (var bk of assemblage.bikes) {
        var fx = bk.x + bk.size + ((bk.size / 20) | 0);
        wchntGraphics.beginFill(bk.colour);
        wchntGraphics.lineStyle(1, 0x000000);
        wchntGraphics.drawCircle(bk.x, bk.y, bk.size / 2);
        wchntGraphics.drawCircle(bk.x, bk.y, bk.size / 4);
        wchntGraphics.drawCircle(fx, bk.y, bk.size / 2);
        wchntGraphics.drawCircle(fx, bk.y, bk.size / 4);
        wchntGraphics.drawLine(bk.x, bk.y, fx, bk.y);
        wchntGraphics.noStroke();
    }
}
```
